; Built-in airplane dashboard of Rigs of Rods, drawn with DearIMGUI by AngelScript (imgui_airplane.as).
; It has no layout file on purpose: the script draws everything (see DashBoardManager::loadDashBoard()).
; Instruments: airspeed, altimeter, vertical speed, attitude, angle of attack, heading (HSI with ILS),
; per-engine RPM/pitch/torque, throttle levers, start buttons and the autopilot.

dashboard_name "ImGui - Airplane"
dashboard_description "Built-in airplane dashboard: flight instruments, engines with throttle levers and start buttons, autopilot"
dashboard_category   204
